#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "An introduction to VQE covering basic building blocks and applications."
msgstr "Pengenalan kepada VQE meliputi blok binaan asas dan aplikasi."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-chem-with-vqe/hero.svg)\n"
msgstr "![\"Imej hero\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-chem-with-vqe/hero.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Welcome to **Quantum chemistry with VQE**. The variational quantum eigensolver (VQE) is a quantum algorithm with applications in quantum chemistry and simulation. In this introductory course, you will learn the basic building blocks of VQE, options in its implementation, and a few applications. Content is delivered through a combination of text, video, and code.\n"
msgstr "Selamat datang ke **Kimia kuantum dengan VQE**. Variational quantum eigensolver (VQE) ialah algoritma kuantum dengan aplikasi dalam kimia kuantum dan simulasi. Dalam kursus pengenalan ini, anda akan mempelajari blok binaan asas VQE, pilihan dalam pelaksanaannya, dan beberapa aplikasi. Kandungan disampaikan melalui gabungan teks, video, dan kod.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Principle topics include:\n"
msgstr "Topik utama termasuk:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hamiltonians\n"
msgstr "Hamiltonian\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ansaetze\n"
msgstr "Ansaetze\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Classical optimizers\n"
msgstr "Pengoptimum klasik\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finding ground state energies using Qiskit patterns\n"
msgstr "Mencari tenaga keadaan dasar menggunakan corak Qiskit\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finding bond lengths using Qiskit patterns\n"
msgstr "Mencari panjang ikatan menggunakan corak Qiskit\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This course focuses on applications to quantum chemistry, though many of the same building blocks (ansatz circuits, classical optimizers, and the Qiskit patterns framework) can be applied to a wide range of fields outside quantum chemistry.\n"
msgstr "Kursus ini memberi tumpuan kepada aplikasi dalam kimia kuantum, walaupun banyak blok binaan yang sama (litar ansatz, pengoptimum klasik, dan rangka kerja corak Qiskit) boleh digunakan pada pelbagai bidang di luar kimia kuantum.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Helpful resources {#helpful-resources}"
msgstr "Sumber yang berguna {#helpful-resources}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This introduction to VQE is designed for intermediate learners of quantum computing techniques. No background in VQE is required. Familiarity with Qiskit, and some familiarity with quantum mechanics and related mathematics (such as operators) is assumed. We recommend devoting approximately 6-10 hours to completing this content, depending on one's prior experience.\n"
msgstr "Pengenalan kepada VQE ini direka untuk pelajar pertengahan teknik pengkomputeran kuantum. Tiada latar belakang dalam VQE diperlukan. Kebiasaan dengan Qiskit, dan sedikit kebiasaan dengan mekanik kuantum dan matematik berkaitan (seperti operator) adalah diasumsikan. Kami mengesyorkan meluangkan kira-kira 6-10 jam untuk menyelesaikan kandungan ini, bergantung pada pengalaman terdahulu seseorang.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The course on [Basics of Quantum Information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information/index) may be helpful in providing background and fundamentals of quantum information and computing.\n"
msgstr "Kursus tentang [Asas Maklumat Kuantum](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information/index) mungkin berguna dalam menyediakan latar belakang dan asas maklumat dan pengkomputeran kuantum.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam {#exam}"
msgstr "Peperiksaan {#exam}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To earn your badge for Quantum Chemistry with VQE, take the exam at IBM&reg; Training. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the lessons in this course. After you pass the exam, you will be notified by Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mendapatkan lencana untuk Kimia Kuantum dengan VQE, ambil peperiksaan di IBM&reg; Training. Peperiksaan ini dimaksudkan untuk diambil setelah membaca pelajaran dalam kursus ini. Selepas anda lulus peperiksaan, anda akan diberitahu oleh Credly bahawa anda telah memperoleh lencana.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Exam](/learning/courses/quantum-chem-with-vqe/exam)\n"
msgstr "[Peperiksaan](/learning/courses/quantum-chem-with-vqe/exam)\n"

